option "operating_currency" "CNY"
1970-01-01 commodity CNY
2024-01-01 open Assets:Bank
2024-01-01 open Assets:Cash
2024-01-01 open Income:Salary
2024-01-01 open Expenses:Food

2024-01-10 * "Employer" "salary"
  Assets:Bank 100 CNY
  Income:Salary

; padding an account from itself books nothing, so the check that follows it fails
2024-02-01 balance Assets:Bank 120 CNY with pad Assets:Bank
2024-02-01 balance Assets:Cash 0 CNY
2024-02-01 * "Shop" "on the day of the pad"
  Assets:Bank -5 CNY
  Expenses:Food

; already at the asserted amount: no padding, and the check passes
2024-02-02 balance Assets:Bank 95 CNY with pad Assets:Bank
2024-02-02 balance Assets:Bank 95 CNY
